# =============================================================
# Production environment variables — committed ON PURPOSE.
#
# VITE_* variables are PUBLIC: Vite inlines them into the client
# bundle at build time, so they can never be secrets. Shipping them
# here means Vercel / CI production builds get the Google Sheets
# config without needing dashboard env vars. To override for a
# specific deployment, set them in Vercel → Settings → Environment
# Variables (those take precedence over this file).
# =============================================================

